Repeated `--type` keeps those types sorted by type then number, `--exclude` drops a
named record and ignores a ref not in the tier, and `--titles` prints the title before
the summary.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/value/0001-first.md --
---
type: value
title: First
summary: The first value.
---
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/rule/0001-only.md --
---
type: rule
title: Only rule
summary: A constraint.
status: accepted
---
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/adr/0001-first.md --
---
type: adr
title: First choice
summary: A decision.
status: accepted
---
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/adr/0002-second.md --
---
type: adr
title: Second choice
summary: The draft.
status: proposed
---
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/adr/0003-third.md --
---
type: adr
title: Third choice
summary: Another decision.
status: accepted
---
-- cmd --
booping specs ls --type value --type adr --exclude adr/0002 --exclude adr/0099 --titles
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
adr/0001  accepted  First choice: A decision.
adr/0003  accepted  Third choice: Another decision.
value/0001  -  First: The first value.
